Read Excel
     ↓
For Each Row
     ↓
Check Company Name
     ↓
Is Company Name Empty?
      ↙              ↘
    Yes               No
     ↓                 ↓
"This is empty     Enter Excel
field"             value
      ↘             ↙
       Submit Record
