```

## Important Expression

To check whether a field is empty:
String.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(CurrentRow("Company Name").ToString)

If it is empty
"This is empty field"

Otherwise:

CurrentRow("Company Name").ToString

## Result

The automation successfully reads the Excel records, checks for empty fields, enters **"This is empty field"** when a required field has no value, enters the original data for non-empty fields, and submits each record to the web application.
